      "value": "@{62799be879611c5288c560eb|full_name}: but then please tell me how vrchat would be responsible for the children? because yes i can’t understand your reasoning you are right! the only problem i can see with parental control & vrchat being responsible for something would be, that if someone is being in a public/ kids friendly world/ normal world and doing stuff against the ToS. but wouldn’t that be the same thing as now? i really want to understand how VRChat would be responsible in your mind as with the suggestion/theory mentioned i tried to think of something where VRChat itself would compromise as little as possible and would have as little additional responsibility as possible",
